  "description": "Player-to-player item trading for SetNet: server-authoritative two-party escrow with a two-phase (ready → confirm) lock that stops last-second offer swaps, and an atomic cross-swap through SetNet.Inventory that rolls back if either side's holdings changed. server.UseTrade(inventory) + client.UseTrade(). Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Inventory.",
